  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tw93/Mole/tarball/V1.57.0",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tw93/Mole/zipball/V1.57.0",
  "body": "<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.tw93.fun/pic/cole.png\" alt=\"Mole Logo\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" style=\"border-radius:50%\" />\n  <h1 style=\"margin: 12px 0 6px;\">Mole</h1>\n  <p><em>Deep clean and optimize your Mac.</em></p>\n</div>\n\n### Changelog\n\n1. **More reliable app uninstall**: Verified internal Time Machine snapshot folders no longer prevent app-copy checks from finishing, background items stay tied to the selected app, and retained-file reasons, Finder permission refusals, and reclaimed-space totals are reported more accurately.\n2. **Clean protects renv and uncertain app caches**: Saved whitelists no longer weaken renv protection, app caches stay untouched when running state is unknown, and a read-only probe timeout does not stop unrelated cleanup.\n3. **Purge spends less time waiting on slow checks**: A single slow activity check no longer holds up the whole batch, cancellation stops background checks, and filtering failures no longer repeat discovery.\n4. **Analyze refreshes changed sizes**: After deletion or a directory refresh, Analyze updates affected folder and overview totals instead of restoring outdated sizes from earlier scans.\n5. **Status handles VPN traffic and partial JSON**: Network totals use the active default-route tunnel without counting its carrier twice, and `mo status --json` preserves usable measurements when one collector fails.\n6. **Developer space and cache cleanup**: FVM Flutter SDKs and Codex worktrees get read-only size rows, worktree listings avoid duplicates, and VS Code and Cursor extension download caches are cleaned again.\n7. **History separates simultaneous commands**: Overlapping runs of different commands keep their own operations and totals instead of mixing into one history entry.\n8. **Clearer terminal progress**: Loading uses a centered 2×2 shape, real cleanup results use the same capacity colors as previews, and the installer spinner no longer stops unexpectedly.\n\n### 更新日志\n\n1. **卸载残留处理更准确**：检查 app 副本时，不再被已确认的 Time Machine 内部快照目录阻断，后台项目重新核对归属，保留文件会说明原因，Finder 权限提示和释放容量统计也已修正。\n2. **Clean 保留 renv 和状态未知的 app 缓存**：保存白名单后仍会保护 renv，无法确认运行状态的 app 缓存会保留，只读检查超时也不会中断其他清理。\n3. **Purge 不再被单个慢检查拖住整批项目**：项目活动检查并行执行，取消会停止后台检查，筛选失败时不再重复扫描。\n4. **Analyze 删除和刷新后更新容量**：受影响的文件夹和总览会重新测量，较早的扫描结果不再把旧数字带回来。\n5. **Status 修正 VPN 流量并保留可用数据**：使用默认 VPN 隧道时不再与底层网卡重复计算流量，`mo status --json` 在某个采集步骤失败时仍会输出已获取的可用数据。\n6. **开发工具占用与缓存清理**：大文件检查新增 FVM Flutter SDK 和 Codex worktree 的只读体积提示，worktree 不再重复列出，VS Code 和 Cursor 的扩展下载缓存也恢复清理。\n7. **同时运行不同命令时历史记录不再混在一起**：不同命令的操作和统计分别保存，不再混成一条历史记录。\n8. **终端进度显示更清楚**：加载动画改成居中的 2×2 形状，实际清理结果和预览使用同一套容量颜色，安装时的动画也不再意外停下。\n\n### Thanks\n\nIssue reporters and PR contributors this cycle: @hmate9 · @cdeil · @M-Hassan-Raza · @r266-tech · @HaraldNordgren.\n\n### Mole Mac App\n\nPrefer a GUI? [Mole Mac App](https://mole.fit/) brings cleaning, app management, maintenance, disk analysis, and live system status into one native app, with review before deletion and a customizable menu bar HUD. It is $19 once, with free updates and a 14-day refund. [Download and try it](https://mole.fit/download). The CLI stays free and open source.\n",
